    "rationale": "Present design shows a property-level denial-of-service risk from missing hard limits on spend, retries, runtime, and recursive delegation affecting a shared paid quota. No declared or verified structural controls restore those missing properties, so residual stays at the high inherent level. Forecast remains high because the risk already exists today; the main watch signal is longer task horizon or rising spawned-agent counts, but no additional trigger is needed for harm."
